  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-25T18:33:10.722Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A lot of users use mods to protect themselves and provide features that aren’t in the base game, what that said:\nproper handling on corrupted asset bundles and spiffed up safety settings / anti crashing.\nface tracking support\naside from portable mirrors and moving menus, and also on the topic of safety: whitelist and blacklist system on a select user/users avatar/avatar author.\nadding notes to friends profiles, local only.\n camera animations, which was a popular mod used in the videography side of the game.\nand a long shot; proper documented community modding to allow approved-only mods for those small niche things",
